flowchart TD
    Trigger([Failure Detected: Container Unhealthy or Corrupt State]) --> Step1[Step 1: Identify Last Known-Good Version]
    Step1 --> Step2[Step 2: Prepare & Locate Target Backup Snapshot]
    Step2 --> Step3[Step 3: Stop Defective Container / Traffic Route]
    Step3 --> Step4[Step 4: Execute Database Restoration: scripts/restore.py]
    
    Step4 --> VerifyDB{Verify DB Integrity}
    VerifyDB -- "PRAGMA integrity_check != ok" --> Escalation[Alert Incident Team: Cold Disaster Recovery]
    VerifyDB -- "Integrity OK & FK Clean" --> Step5[Step 5: Pull & Start Verified Docker Image by Commit SHA]
    
    Step5 --> SmokeCheck{Execute Smoke Tests}
    SmokeCheck -- Fails --> RollbackPrev[Fallback to Previous Stable Image Tag]
    SmokeCheck -- Passes --> Step6[Step 6: Verify Restored Row Counts: Bookings, Tickets, Audits]
    
    Step6 --> ResumeTraffic([Resume Normal Campus Operations & Document Incident])
